      "id": "2122923871385067562",
      "text": "Jim Montgomery: \"In the first 50 minutes, we did a good job -- not a great job -- of recognizing a game when the D-men were tight and playing to the goal line and when we had time to make plays because in the second period we made some really nice plays off the rush.\" #stlblues",
