      "quoted_author": "",
      "quoted_handle": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "2122923376905716056",
      "text": "Jim Montgomery: \"I liked the way we started the game. We started fast, we started predictable and it led to a lot of O-zone shifts where I think that might have been our best OZP game where we played fast in the O-zone and we've got to continue to build on that.\" #stlblues",
      "url": "https://x.com/lkorac10/status/2122923376905716056",
      "published": "2026-11-18T05:22:29+00:00",
      "likes": 10,
      "author": "Lou Korac",
      "handle": "lkorac10",
      "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1752217501314727936/DBDsiYG0_normal.jpg",
      "media": "",
      "quoted_text": "",
      "quoted_author": "",
      "quoted_handle": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "2122918109820465521",
      "text": "Thomas: \"It was nice to see some go in finally. We scored a bunch of different ways. We beat them on changes up the ice. We moved the puck quick. There was a couple of goals right around the net. We scored in multiple ways. Thats what makes a dynamic team and it was great to see\"",
